          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On November 6, 1978, around 7:30 am, three individuals observed the slow movement of a bright object that intrigued them. No noise was heard during the observation of this orange-colored object. The gendarmerie, contacted in the afternoon, was unable to make any findings. No other testimony regarding this phenomenon was collected by the gendarmerie, for which we lack details.",
